OL,3,GNEWSAPolice confirm 'targeted attack'
OL,4,Aafter man named in suspected shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man killed in a suspected shooting at
OL,7,Fa house in West Lothian has been named
OL,8,Flocally as 35-year-old William Watson.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland confirmed that the
OL,11,Fincident on Saturday in Harestanes
OL,12,FRoad, Armadale, was a targeted attack.
OL,13,FIt is investigating if a firearm was
OL,14,Fused.
OL,16,FWatson, known as Billy, died at the
OL,17,Fscene. The area remained cordoned off
OL,18,Fon Monday with officers posted outside
OL,19,Fthe property.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
