OL,3,GNEWSAPolice confirm 'targeted attack'
OL,4,Aafter man named in suspected shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are also investigating whether a
OL,7,Fnearby car fire in Netherhouses and a
OL,8,Ffire at a derelict house on Wotherspoon
OL,9,FRoad on Saturday are linked to the
OL,10,Fincident.
